The source documents in docs/ are reports of the US Army Concepts Analysis Agency by
Robert L. Helmbold (CAA-RP-90-01, CAA-RP-90-03 and CAA-RP-90-04, 1990), approved for public
release with distribution unlimited. As works of the United States Government they are not
subject to copyright in the United States (17 U.S.C. 105).

The data in data/ are transcribed from CAA-RP-90-04 and are in the public domain on the same
basis. To the extent that any copyright or database right subsists in the transcription,
compilation or arrangement of these files, it is dedicated to the public domain under the
Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal Public Domain Dedication:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

Third-party material: the reports quote and summarize other published works, for example the
books excerpted in Appendix B (data/anecdotes.json) and the sources described in
data/datasets.json. Those passages remain subject to whatever rights their authors and
publishers hold; this notice does not grant rights in them.

The data are provided as is, without warranty of any kind.
